      "Title": "BooseSoftware.BooseCanvas",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/BooseSoftware.BooseCanvas.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A fully functional implementation of the BOOSE <xref href=\"BOOSE.ICanvas\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> interface\nusing real GDI+ graphics. All drawing operations are performed on an in-memory <xref href=\"System.Drawing.Bitmap\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nthat can be displayed in a <xref href=\"System.Windows.Forms.PictureBox\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> or saved to file.</p>\n"
    },
